{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"写的是短暂安定退去、最初的迟疑重新出现和下一步尚未明确，没有把门槛比喻写成真实行动，也没有新增前史、人物关系或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把他已经辨明的眷恋对象说成那种亲近的生活，并保留了仍无从解决的困境，没有把珠子里的比喻写成真实事件或添加具体情节。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S08-2已经说明安静只能暂时缓解紧绷、不能解决眼前的问题，因此安静退去后旧迟疑重新出现有充分前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-1能说明他舍不得的究竟是哪种生活，却不能单独解释他为什么仍答不上如何留住它，只支撑了目标句的前半部分。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"两条线能连成清楚的心理过程：短暂安定退去，旧迟疑重现，而他虽然已经知道自己想保住什么，却仍找不到解决办法。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S09-1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“安静退去”和“刚聚起的稳定很快散了”都在表达短暂安定消退，意思有所重叠，可以删去其中一处；其余内容分别交代迟疑回返和下一步未明，不必一并删掉。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e3b5d8ed-cec3-4b05-9150-85c85373a10d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T052437158078Z", "elapsed_seconds": 110.172, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:26:27.347622+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0c916c737e7184217799f0e44e54a829bdef9ca822d400338585a79dfa3495c3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth",